BT /F1 10 Tf 54 227 Td (   sup-warranty-terms-2025 the O2 sensor carries 18 months.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 214 Td (- Docking. HX-DOCK-4 runs automatic bump tests and calibration for four instruments at once,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 201 Td (   and records results for audit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 188 Td (- Cold weather. The HX-220 works down to -40 C, well below both competitors.) Tj ET
