BT /F2 13 Tf 54 726 Td (Critical guidance: Zone 0 work) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 704 Td (The HX-220 is certified II 2G Ex ib IIC T4 Gb, which is Zone 1 only. It must not be proposed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 691 Td (for Zone 0 areas such as the inside of tanks, vessels and sewers during entry. If the customer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 678 Td (needs Zone 0, recommend the HX-210 \(II 1G Ex ia IIC T4 Ga\). If they also want connectivity,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 665 Td (propose a mixed fleet: HX-210 for entrants and HX-220 for attendants and area patrols.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 652 Td (Brightline will attack us on this point, because the BL-Quad is Zone 0 and has Bluetooth.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 639 Td (Answer with runtime \(HX-210 14 h against 12 h\), our longer warranty and the dock.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 617 Td (The HX-200 is certified for gas group IIB only \(Ex ib IIB T4 Gb\). Do not propose it where) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 604 Td (hydrogen or acetylene may be present. Those gases fall in group IIC.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 579 Td (Objection handling) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 558 Td (Objection | Response) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 546 Td ("Corvane is 15% cheaper." | Compare over three years. Include sensor replacements, the 24-month) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 534 Td (versus 36-month warranty, and calibration gas used. The HX-210's 120-day interval uses fewer) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 522 Td (MI-CAL-Q4-B cylinders than 90-day competitors.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 510 Td ("Brightline has Zone 0 and Bluetooth in one unit." | True. Position a mixed HX-210/HX-220 fleet) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 498 Td (and lead on the HX-220's 22 h runtime and -40 C rating for the patrol role.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 486 Td ("Your calibration interval went from 180 to 120 days." | The HX-210 calibration procedure v2) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 474 Td (\(May 2025\) moved to 25% LEL span gas and 120 days after field drift data. Present it as a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 462 Td (quality improvement. Brightline still needs 90 days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 450 Td ("We already have Corvane docks." | Offer a trade-in on competitor docks through the deal desk.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 438 Td (This counts toward the total discount under the approval matrix.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 413 Td (Discounting guidance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 391 Td (Keep competitive discounts within 20% where possible. Anything above 20% needs VP Sales) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 378 Td (approval under sales-discount-approval-matrix. Record the competitor's name in the Atlas) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 365 Td (opportunity so win/loss reporting stays accurate.) Tj ET
